Z||000014||84Bill||06-05-2001||06:13 PM||||Here are the pics of the drain holes built into the sub roof. The first pic os looking from the rear outside of the car.<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://cn308598-a.wall1.pa.home.com/fiero/sunroof1/image002.jpg">  <BR>This pic shows the location a bit better<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://cn308598-a.wall1.pa.home.com/fiero/sunroof1/image014.jpg">  <P>this is the inside shot of the same factory drain hole<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://cn308598-a.wall1.pa.home.com/fiero/sunroof1/image004.jpg">   <P>and this is a pic of where I suspect the hole gets drilled to drain away the water. it's under the inside REAR corner of the sunroof<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://cn308598-a.wall1.pa.home.com/fiero/sunroof1/image006.jpg">   <P>Hope this helps<P><BR>[This message has been edited by 84Bill (edited 06-05-2001).]<p>[This message has been edited by 84Bill (edited 06-05-2001).]||||reg||14
